  "instagram_caption": "Wibbo found a mystery egg! Is it a bouncy ball? The sun? No, Wibbo!\n\nLots of fish hatch from eggs. Clownfish dads guard their eggs and fan them clean for about 6 to 7 days until they hatch.\n\nSilly Wibbo. Smart kids.\n\nWhat animal should hatch from the next mystery egg?\n\n#wibbo #kidslearning #guessinggame #funnykids #fish",
